#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.1.0"
msgstr "v1.1.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.1.0 makes OpenMV IDE firmware-aware: built on Qt Creator 4.0.2, it now "
"detects an out-of-date OpenMV Cam on connect and upgrades its firmware "
"automatically over the serial bootloader, adds support for the new Cortex-M7"
" OpenMV Cam, and turns the General Messages pane into a proper Serial "
"Terminal. This release changes a few default behaviors (firmware auto-"
"upgrade and Python file filters) that users should be aware of; see "
":ref:`Breaking changes <changelog_ide_v1_1_0>` below."
msgstr ""
"v1.1.0 membuat OpenMV IDE mengenali firmware: dibangun di atas Qt Creator "
"4.0.2, versi ini kini mendeteksi OpenMV Cam yang firmware-nya sudah usang "
"saat terhubung dan memperbarui firmware secara otomatis melalui bootloader "
"serial, menambahkan dukungan untuk OpenMV Cam Cortex-M7 baru, dan mengubah "
"panel General Messages menjadi Serial Terminal yang sesungguhnya. Rilis ini "
"mengubah beberapa perilaku default (pembaruan firmware otomatis dan filter "
"file Python) yang perlu diperhatikan pengguna; lihat :ref:`Perubahan yang "
"memecah kompatibilitas <changelog_ide_v1_1_0>` di bawah."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Automatic firmware upgrade** — on connect, the IDE detects an out-of-date "
"OpenMV Cam and flashes the bundled firmware over the serial bootloader, with"
" an option to also erase the internal filesystem."
msgstr ""
"**Pembaruan firmware otomatis** — saat terhubung, IDE mendeteksi OpenMV Cam "
"yang firmware-nya usang dan mem-flash firmware yang dibundel melalui "
"bootloader serial, dengan opsi untuk juga menghapus sistem file internal."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Cortex-M7 OpenMV Cam support** — the new STM32F769-based board (``OMV7``) "
"is supported alongside the existing Cortex-M4 board (``OMV2``), with per-"
"board firmware and auto-detection."
msgstr ""
"**Dukungan OpenMV Cam Cortex-M7** — board berbasis STM32F769 baru (\\ "
"``OMV7``\\ ) didukung bersama board Cortex-M4 yang sudah ada (\\ ``OMV2``\\ "
"), dengan firmware per-board dan deteksi otomatis."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Unbrick recovery** — if no camera is found, the IDE can force-flash the "
"matching firmware to a bricked camera once it is reconnected."
msgstr ""
"**Pemulihan unbrick** — jika tidak ada kamera yang ditemukan, IDE dapat "
"memaksa-flash firmware yang cocok ke kamera yang rusak setelah disambungkan "
"kembali."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Serial Terminal** — the General Messages pane is now a dark-themed "
"``Serial Terminal`` with 100000-line scrollback that pops up on output."
msgstr ""
"**Serial Terminal** — panel General Messages kini menjadi ``Serial "
"Terminal`` bertemakan gelap dengan scrollback 100000 baris yang muncul saat "
"ada output."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Non-blocking connect/disconnect** — connecting, reconnecting, and shutdown"
" now run asynchronously with progress dialogs so the IDE no longer hangs."
msgstr ""
"**Koneksi/diskoneksi non-blokir** — menghubungkan, menyambungkan kembali, "
"dan shutdown kini berjalan secara asinkron dengan dialog kemajuan sehingga "
"IDE tidak lagi hang."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Live binary and grayscale preview** — the frame buffer viewer renders "
"1-bit and grayscale images in addition to RGB565 and JPEG."
msgstr ""
"**Pratinjau biner dan skala abu-abu langsung** — penampil frame buffer "
"merender citra 1-bit dan skala abu-abu selain RGB565 dan JPEG."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:38
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Automatic firmware upgrade.** When a connected OpenMV Cam reports a "
"firmware version older than the bundled ``firmware.txt``, the IDE starts the"
" bootloader, erases flash sectors, programs ``firmware.bin`` in chunks with "
"progress dialogs, and resets the camera. The user may optionally erase the "
"internal filesystem as part of the upgrade. (`a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `50375ee95 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/50375ee95>`__, `502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__, `a871bfb48 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a871bfb48>`__, `30eb9e0dc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/30eb9e0dc>`__, `552803018 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/552803018>`__, `889bc38fb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/889bc38fb>`__, `047581ed5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/047581ed5>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Pembaruan firmware otomatis.** Ketika OpenMV Cam yang terhubung melaporkan"
" versi firmware yang lebih lama dari ``firmware.txt`` yang dibundel, IDE "
"memulai bootloader, menghapus sektor flash, memprogram ``firmware.bin`` "
"dalam potongan dengan dialog kemajuan, dan mereset kamera. Pengguna dapat "
"secara opsional menghapus sistem file internal sebagai bagian dari "
"pembaruan. (\\ `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `50375ee95 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/50375ee95>`__\\ , `502177f3c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/502177f3c>`__\\ , `a871bfb48 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a871bfb48>`__\\ , `30eb9e0dc <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/30eb9e0dc>`__\\ , `552803018 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/552803018>`__\\ , `889bc38fb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/889bc38fb>`__\\ , `047581ed5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/047581ed5>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Unbrick recovery path.** If no OpenMV Cam is found, the IDE asks whether a"
" bricked camera is attached, lets you pick the board type, and force-flashes"
" the matching firmware once the device is reconnected. (`a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `30eb9e0dc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/30eb9e0dc>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Jalur pemulihan unbrick.** Jika tidak ada OpenMV Cam yang ditemukan, IDE "
"bertanya apakah kamera yang rusak terpasang, memungkinkan Anda memilih jenis"
" board, dan memaksa-flash firmware yang cocok setelah perangkat disambungkan"
" kembali. (\\ `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `30eb9e0dc <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/30eb9e0dc>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Save script and reset actions.** New ``Tools`` menu entries save the "
"current script to the OpenMV Cam's flash drive (``Save script to OpenMV "
"Cam``) and reset the camera (``Reset OpenMV Cam``); ``Stop`` also gained a "
"``Ctrl+T`` keyboard shortcut. (`9fc3dfa5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9fc3dfa5a>`__, `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `889bc38fb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/889bc38fb>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Simpan skrip dan aksi reset.** Entri menu ``Tools`` baru menyimpan skrip "
"saat ini ke drive flash OpenMV Cam (\\ ``Save script to OpenMV Cam``\\ ) dan"
" mereset kamera (\\ ``Reset OpenMV Cam``\\ ); ``Stop`` juga mendapat "
"pintasan keyboard ``Ctrl+T``\\ . (\\ `9fc3dfa5a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9fc3dfa5a>`__\\ , `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `889bc38fb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/889bc38fb>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Update notification and local docs.** The IDE checks openmv.io on startup "
"for a newer IDE version and shows a download notification. The ``Docs`` "
"``Help`` action now opens locally bundled HTML documentation "
"(``html/index.html``) and the pinout action opens the bundled pinout image "
"(``html/_images/pinout.png``) instead of the website. (`a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `50375ee95 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/50375ee95>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Notifikasi pembaruan dan dokumentasi lokal.** IDE memeriksa openmv.io saat"
" startup untuk versi IDE yang lebih baru dan menampilkan notifikasi unduhan."
" Aksi ``Docs`` ``Help`` kini membuka dokumentasi HTML yang dibundel secara "
"lokal (\\ ``html/index.html``\\ ) dan aksi pinout membuka citra pinout yang "
"dibundel (\\ ``html/_images/pinout.png``\\ ) alih-alih situs web. (\\ "
"`a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , "
"`50375ee95 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/50375ee95>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Binary and grayscale frame buffer.** The frame buffer viewer now renders "
"binary (1-bit) and grayscale images in addition to RGB565 and JPEG, and the "
"frame buffer can be toggled on and off live from the toolbar; the older "
"JPEG-compress toolbar button was hidden in favor of this on/off toggle. "
"(`a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Frame buffer biner dan skala abu-abu.** Penampil frame buffer kini "
"merender citra biner (1-bit) dan skala abu-abu selain RGB565 dan JPEG, dan "
"frame buffer dapat dihidupkan dan dimatikan secara langsung dari toolbar; "
"tombol toolbar JPEG-compress lama disembunyikan demi toggle hidup/mati ini. "
"(\\ `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ "
")"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:77
msgid ""
"**New and updated examples.** Added a CPU overclocking example (up to "
"216MHz), an improved multi-client MJPEG WiFi streamer, an FPS test, and a "
"colorbar test that adapts to the OV7725 sensor. (`a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `32dc31962 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/32dc31962>`__, `502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Contoh baru dan yang diperbarui.** Ditambahkan contoh overclocking CPU "
"(hingga 216MHz), MJPEG WiFi streamer multi-klien yang ditingkatkan, tes FPS,"
" dan tes colorbar yang beradaptasi dengan sensor OV7725. (\\ `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `32dc31962 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/32dc31962>`__\\ , `502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:85
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan perbaikan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Serial Terminal.** The General Messages pane was repurposed as a ``Serial "
"Terminal`` with a dark background, raised status-bar priority, 100000-line "
"scrollback, and no word wrap. It pops up and flashes when the camera prints "
"output. (`9fc3dfa5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9fc3dfa5a>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Serial Terminal.** Panel General Messages diubah fungsinya menjadi "
"``Serial Terminal`` dengan latar belakang gelap, prioritas bilah status yang"
" ditingkatkan, scrollback 100000 baris, dan tanpa word wrap. Panel ini "
"muncul dan berkedip saat kamera mencetak output. (\\ `9fc3dfa5a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9fc3dfa5a>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Non-blocking connect and disconnect.** Connect and disconnect were "
"reworked to be non-blocking with progress dialogs and a clean asynchronous "
"shutdown, so the IDE no longer hangs while the camera is busy and shows "
"``Busy... please wait...`` instead. (`502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__, `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `6275d8855 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6275d8855>`__, `234f76389 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/234f76389>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Koneksi dan diskoneksi non-blokir.** Koneksi dan diskoneksi dirombak "
"menjadi non-blokir dengan dialog kemajuan dan shutdown asinkron yang bersih,"
" sehingga IDE tidak lagi hang saat kamera sibuk dan menampilkan ``Busy... "
"please wait...`` sebagai gantinya. (\\ `502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__\\ , `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `6275d8855 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6275d8855>`__\\ , `234f76389 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/234f76389>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:100
msgid ""
"**Smoothed FPS readout.** The FPS readout is now a smoothed running average "
"over the last several frames instead of an instantaneous value, with a "
"tooltip noting it may differ from the camera FPS. (`a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `889bc38fb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/889bc38fb>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Tampilan FPS yang dihaluskan.** Tampilan FPS kini merupakan rata-rata "
"berjalan yang dihaluskan atas beberapa bingkai terakhir alih-alih nilai "
"instan, dengan tooltip yang mencatat bahwa nilainya mungkin berbeda dari FPS"
" kamera. (\\ `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `889bc38fb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/889bc38fb>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Dark theme polish.** The dark theme gained custom-styled scrollbars with "
"arrow images across editors and panes, dark-themed search-result and scope "
"highlighting in the Inkpot style, and white text in the ``Find`` toolbar. "
"(`9fc3dfa5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9fc3dfa5a>`__, "
"`94d8c41f1 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/94d8c41f1>`__, "
"`9d8683355 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9d8683355>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Polesan tema gelap.** Tema gelap mendapat scrollbar bergaya kustom dengan "
"citra panah di editor dan panel, penyorotan hasil pencarian dan cakupan "
"bertemakan gelap dengan gaya Inkpot, dan teks putih di toolbar ``Find``\\ . "
"(\\ `9fc3dfa5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9fc3dfa5a>`__\\ "
", `94d8c41f1 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/94d8c41f1>`__\\ , "
"`9d8683355 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9d8683355>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:111
msgid ""
"**Python-oriented file defaults.** ``Find in Files`` now defaults its file "
"filter to ``*.py`` and the file-open dialog shows all files, matching "
"MicroPython development rather than C++. (`94d8c41f1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/94d8c41f1>`__, `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Default file berorientasi Python.** ``Find in Files`` kini menggunakan "
"filter file default ``*.py`` dan dialog buka-file menampilkan semua file, "
"sesuai dengan pengembangan MicroPython alih-alih C++. (\\ `94d8c41f1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/94d8c41f1>`__\\ , `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:118
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:120
msgid ""
"Improved serial-port handling on macOS (filter to port names containing "
"``cu``) and Linux (clearer permission-denied guidance suggesting ``sudo "
"adduser <user> dialout``), suppressed an SSL warning, made bootloader "
"dialogs application-modal, and adjusted bootloader timing and timeouts for "
"reliability. (`a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `552803018 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/552803018>`__, `a871bfb48 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a871bfb48>`__, `30eb9e0dc <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/30eb9e0dc>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Penanganan port serial yang ditingkatkan di macOS (filter ke nama port yang "
"mengandung ``cu``\\ ) dan Linux (panduan izin ditolak yang lebih jelas "
"menyarankan ``sudo adduser <user> dialout``\\ ), menekan peringatan SSL, "
"membuat dialog bootloader application-modal, dan menyesuaikan timing dan "
"timeout bootloader untuk keandalan. (\\ `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `552803018 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/552803018>`__\\ , `a871bfb48 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a871bfb48>`__\\ , `30eb9e0dc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/30eb9e0dc>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:129
msgid ""
"The IDE now opens the ``helloworld.py`` example automatically when no "
"document is open on launch and reliably closes the splash screen, fixing "
"edit-window and startup state issues. (`a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__, `9d8683355 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9d8683355>`__, `502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"IDE kini membuka contoh ``helloworld.py`` secara otomatis saat tidak ada "
"dokumen yang terbuka saat peluncuran dan menutup splash screen dengan andal,"
" memperbaiki masalah jendela edit dan status startup. (\\ `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ , `9d8683355 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9d8683355>`__\\ , `502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:137
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Dukungan platform dan alat"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:139
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Dasar Qt Creator:** 4.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:140
msgid ""
"**OpenMV IDE version:** bumped from 1.0.0 to 1.1.0. (`50375ee95 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/50375ee95>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Versi OpenMV IDE:** ditingkatkan dari 1.0.0 ke 1.1.0. (\\ `50375ee95 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/50375ee95>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:142
msgid ""
"**New board:** Cortex-M7 OpenMV Cam (STM32F769, ``OMV7``) is now supported "
"alongside the Cortex-M4 OpenMV Cam (STM32F427, ``OMV2``), with per-board "
"firmware directories and board-string auto-detection via ``boards.txt``. "
"(`a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Board baru:** OpenMV Cam Cortex-M7 (STM32F769, ``OMV7``\\ ) kini didukung "
"bersama OpenMV Cam Cortex-M4 (STM32F427, ``OMV2``\\ ), dengan direktori "
"firmware per-board dan deteksi otomatis string board melalui "
"``boards.txt``\\ . (\\ `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:146
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware:** updated to 1.7.0 and then to 1.8.0 for both ``OMV2`` "
"and ``OMV7`` boards; the bootloader minimum/compatible firmware version is "
"1.6.0. (`502177f3c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/502177f3c>`__, `32dc31962 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/32dc31962>`__, `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Firmware yang dibundel:** diperbarui ke 1.7.0 lalu ke 1.8.0 untuk board "
"``OMV2`` dan ``OMV7``\\ ; versi firmware minimum/kompatibel bootloader "
"adalah 1.6.0. (\\ `502177f3c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/502177f3c>`__\\ , `32dc31962 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/32dc31962>`__\\ , `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:152
msgid ""
"**Windows USB drivers:** bundled digitally signed Windows USB driver files "
"(``openmv`` and ``pybcdc`` ``.inf``/``.cat``) and packaged the drivers "
"directory with the IDE. (`047581ed5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/047581ed5>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Driver USB Windows:** dibundel file driver USB Windows bertanda tangan "
"digital (\\ ``openmv`` dan ``pybcdc`` ``.inf``\\ /\\ ``.cat``\\ ) dan "
"direktori driver dikemas bersama IDE. (\\ `047581ed5 "
