#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Automatic firmware upgrade on connect.** When the connected OpenMV Cam's "
"firmware is older than the bundled ``firmware.txt`` version, the IDE prompts"
" you to upgrade (and optionally erase the internal filesystem) before "
"letting you continue. Cancelling during the erase or program step can leave "
"the camera bricked until it is reconnected and re-flashed."
msgstr ""
"**Pembaruan firmware otomatis saat terhubung.** Ketika firmware OpenMV Cam "
"yang terhubung lebih lama dari versi ``firmware.txt`` yang dibundel, IDE "
"meminta Anda untuk memperbarui (dan secara opsional menghapus sistem file "
"internal) sebelum mengizinkan Anda melanjutkan. Membatalkan selama langkah "
"penghapusan atau pemrograman dapat membuat kamera rusak sampai disambungkan "
"kembali dan di-flash ulang."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:167
msgid ""
"**Changed file defaults.** The ``Find in Files`` default file filter changed"
" from ``*.cpp,*.h`` to ``*.py``, and the file-open dialog now shows all "
"files instead of per-mimetype filters."
msgstr ""
"**Default file yang berubah.** Filter file default ``Find in Files`` berubah"
" dari ``*.cpp,*.h`` menjadi ``*.py``\\ , dan dialog buka-file kini "
"menampilkan semua file alih-alih filter per-mimetype."
